| ORM/Database Layer    | SQLx                       |
| Authentication        | JWT                        |
| Password Hashing      | Argon2                     |
| Environment Variables | dotenvy                    |
| Logging               | tracing                    |
| Validation            | validator                  |
| Testing               | cargo test                 |
| Containerization      | Docker                     |
| Deployment            | Fly.io, Railway, or Render |

